showintro:
PUSHN 1
PUSHS "\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "+========================================================+\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "|                                                        |\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "|           LATINIUM ROGUELIKE                           |\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "|                                                        |\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "+========================================================+\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "Fabula:\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "Tu es explorator audax. In antro obscuro sub terra\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "dormivisti. Nunc evigilas! Goblini te circumdant.\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "Scala una ad libertatem ducit. Inveni eam!\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "Consilia:\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "- Move per antrum (n/s/e/w vel h/j/k/l)\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "- Vita goblinos (g) - te oppugnant!\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "- Collige pocula (!) - te sanant (+5 PV)\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "- Inveni scalas (>) - ad victoriam ducunt\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "- Si puncta vitae (PV) ad 0 cadunt, morieris\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "Signa:\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "  @ = tu (ludator)        g = goblinus (hostis)\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "  ! = poculum (sanatio)   > = scalae (victoria)\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "  . = solum               # = paries\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "Pressa 'q' ad desinendum.\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "\n"
WRITES
PUSHS "Pressa Enter ad incipiendum..."
WRITES
READS
STOREL 0
PUSHS "\n"
WRITES
RETURN
